/div>Oh, I <b>am</b> watching it---around a third of the way through it. I'm in the Thyrsus segment.<br /> <br /> I said it was <i>weird</i>; I never said it was <i>bad</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Welp, that's some really good material for a dickhead Daimon.<br /> <br /> (For added weirdness, shortly after posting that, I hit the spot where he yells &quot;Leave me alone!&quot; and my computer froze.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":672,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","user":"thenate","date":". 10-21-2016, 06:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-21T14:35:17-07:00","id":991122,"title":"","content":"If any of you have seen Mr Robot (which is a highly <i>highly</i> recommended show for anyone involving techngnosticism or a Free Council heavy Chronicle), the scene from the first episode of season 2 featuring this song <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BgOE6utleqc\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BgOE6utleqc</a><br /> <br /> About a seriously troubled character inventing a rigorously controlled reality for himself so he doesn't have to deal with the difficult parts of his psychology that tell him who he really is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12121-ainsoph","name":"AinSoph","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-22T20:19:19-07:00","id":991680,"title":"","content":"The Venture Brothers, so much. It's pretty much my ideal Awakening campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T07:46:50-07:00","id":992943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thenate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/990708-inspirational-media-for-the-lie?p=991119#post991119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, I <b>am</b> watching it---around a third of the way through it. I'm in the Thyrsus segment.<br /> <br /> I said it was <i>weird</i>; I never said it was <i>bad</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sooooooooo =D? Isn't the ending terrifying?<br /> <br /> The END end changed after that performance. Now, after Pippin and Catherine leave, Theo comes back on stage and starts singing Corner of the Sky, and the Leading Player comes back on stage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T12:55:04-07:00","id":993051,"title":"","content":"I considered that a <i>cheerful</i> ending, honestly.<br /> <br /> First half, I was thinking &quot;Mastigos Awakening&quot;, but given the fourth wall weirdness and, especially, the ending I'm going to call this a good Acanthus Awakening. 'Twas totally embracing the thorns in that ending. Only thing missing was an overt signing, but I figure his grabbing the family could count.<br /> <br /> A thought: If you interpret that as a years-long Mystery Play, the the Fallen World history could still match real life.<br /> If so, imagine his reaction figuring out he <i>really was</i> still a hunchbacked bastard with a much larger family when the lights fade. Maaan, that would be a rude shock.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T13:19:23-07:00","id":993067,"title":"","content":"So Westworld is like gnostic++ and is chock full of ruminations on the moral duty owed by the real to the created and the horror of discovering your world is a lie (and what that could mean in a hands-on, practical sense).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12136-jacobkosh","name":"jacobkosh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"ke